                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicaid is an indispensable lifeline for pregnant women, children, seniors, and people with disabilities. But Democrats let spending spiral out of control, growing twice as fast as inflation from 2018\u20132023. \n\nThey allowed ineligible individuals to stay on the rolls. \n\nPresident Trump's Working Families Tax Cut also restores Medicaid\u2019s mission. It saves $806B by cutting waste, fraud, and abuse. It requires work or service for able-bodied adults who refuse to contribute. It removes 1.6M deceased or duplicate enrollees and 1.3M ineligible recipients. And it reinvests $50B into rural hospitals and expands home and community-based services.",
