                "text": "House Republicans did our job and voted to keep the government open.\n\nWe funded our military, veterans\u2019 healthcare, food assistance programs, and community health centers.\n\nDemocrats blocked all of this. Why? To demand $1.5T of your money for:\n\n\u2022 Benefits for illegal aliens\n\u2022 Propping up liberal news outlets\n\u2022 Repealing rural healthcare investment\n\u2022 Foreign climate projects\n\nBottom line: The @HouseGOP is protecting your financial security. Democrats are shutting down the government to appease the far left",
