                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans did our job: we voted to fund the government and keep it open.\n\nDemocrats are voting to shut it down \u2014 demanding FREE healthcare for illegal aliens, paid for by hardworking taxpayers.\n\nThe funding bill is the SAME short-term extension Democrats supported 13 times under BIDEN.\n\nIf Democrats force a shutdown, they\u2019ll be responsible for:\n\n\u2013 Cutting WIC & food assistance for families\n\u2013 Halting veterans\u2019 benefits & suicide prevention programs\n\u2013 Blocking home treatment options for low-income & Medicare patients\n\u2013 Withholding pay from servicemembers\n\u2013 Delaying FEMA flood insurance during hurricane season\n\u2013 Forcing TSA & air traffic controllers to work without pay\n\u2013 Stalling markets & delaying the Oct. 3 jobs report\n\nBottom line: It\u2019s up to Democrats whether the government shuts down at midnight, Sept. 30.",
